line	<col=000080>Use the desired <col=800000>dye</col> on an empty <col=800000>ogre bellow</col>, then the dyed <col=800000>ogre bellows</col> on a <col=800000>swamp toad</col> to get a <col=800000>coloured toad</col> (at least 1 of each colour).</col>
step	23	-	Quick guide step 23
line	<str>Talk to Eluned.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport to the Outpost using your necklace of passage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Arandar Pass gate, west of the Outpost, and kill a mourner (this will drain your stats including hp to 20).</str>
line	
line	<str>Take everything it drops (7 items), and hold onto them.</str>
line	
line	<str>(Optional) Use a ring of dueling teleport to Ferox Enclave and drink from the Pool of Refreshment to negate mourner potion resetting stats and hp</str>
line	
line	<str>Make your way to Tegid by the Taverley lake, and talk to him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search his laundry basket to get Tegid's soap.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the soap on the bloody mourner top with a bucket of water in your inventory to clean it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport to Lletya using the teleport crystal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Arianwyn.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Oronwen who is directly north-west of the teleport crystal's destination.</str>
line	
line	<str>Give her the silk, bear fur, and trousers.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to West Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the full mourner outfit.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the mourner HQ in the north-east corner of West Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go down the trapdoor and talk to Essyllt in the basement. (2 free inventory spaces needed)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the gnome on a rack. Select the chat option about being tickled and toad crunchies.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the feather on him.</str>
line	
line	<str>Release the gnome and talk to him with soft leather, a magic log, and either toad crunchies or premade t'd crunch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Feldip Hills swamp (east of fairy ring AKS) or the less dangerous swamp south-west of Castle Wars (north-east of fairy ring BKP)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the desired dye on an empty ogre bellow, then the dyed ogre bellows on a swamp toad to get a coloured toad (at least 1 of each colour).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Re-dye one sheep in each group their respective colour.</col>
